OL,3,APutin's Crimea bridge partly collapses
OL,4,Aas Zelensky hails 'unprecedented'
OL,5,Aattack by Ukraine
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Kremlin said it would rebuild the
OL,8,Fbridge "better than before" and that
OL,9,FRussian President Vladimir Putin had
OL,10,Fbeen briefed on the attack, though he
OL,11,Fis yet to comment.
OL,13,FElsewhere, Kyiv Mayor Vitali Klitschko
OL,14,Fsaid the Northern and Southern bridges,
OL,15,Fboth important crossings over the
OL,16,FDnipro River, were closed after Russia
OL,17,Ftargeted the Ukrainian capital
OL,18,Fovernight.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
